OL,3,AMet Office yellow warning in place as
OL,4,Asnow could disrupt Tuesday morning
OL,5,Atravel
OL,6,
OL,7,FParts of northern England and southern
OL,8,FScotland are set to get an early taste
OL,9,Fof winter as hill snow moves in on
OL,10,FTuesday.
OL,12,FA Met Office yellow warning for snow is
OL,13,Fvalid until midday Tuesday with 5-15cm
OL,14,Fexpected at some locations above
OL,15,F300-400m.
OL,17,FMajor routes like the A74(M), A66 and
OL,18,FM62 could all have problems with
OL,19,Ftransport disruption.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
